  ],
  "notes": [
    {
      "chapter": 1,
      "verse": 1,
      "sourceText": "In the days when the judges judged, there was a famine in the land. A certain man of Bethlehem Judah went to live in the country of Moab with his wife and his two sons.",
      "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/RUT01.htm#V1",
      "findingJa": "無名家族を1:2の名前で先取りしない。Bethlehem/Judah/Moabのみ地名直接。"
    },
    {
      "chapter": 1,
      "verse": 2,
      "sourceText": "The name of the man was Elimelech, and the name of his wife Naomi. The names of his two sons were Mahlon and Chilion, Ephrathites of Bethlehem Judah. They came into the country of Moab and lived there.",
      "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/RUT01.htm#V2",
      "findingJa": "Elimelech/Naomi/Mahlon/Chilionの名、Ephrathitesの出身表現。後の個別婚姻対応は未開示。"
    },
    {
      "chapter": 1,
      "verse": 4,
      "sourceText": "They took for themselves wives of the women of Moab. The name of the one was Orpah, and the name of the other was Ruth. They lived there about ten years.",
      "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/RUT01.htm#V4",
      "findingJa": "OrpahとRuthの名前。MahlonとRuthの個別夫婦対応は4:10まで明記されない。"
    },
    {
      "chapter": 1,
      "verse": 15,
      "sourceText": "She said, “Behold, your sister-in-law has gone back to her people and to her god. Follow your sister-in-law.”",
      "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/RUT01.htm#V15",
      "findingJa": "her godはOrpahの神で固有名なし。Chemosh/Dagon等の個体を推定しない。"
    },
    {
      "chapter": 1,
      "verse": 20,
      "sourceText": "She said to them, “Don’t call me Naomi. Call me Mara, for the Almighty has dealt very bitterly with me.",
      "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/RUT01.htm#V20",
      "findingJa": "Naomi/Maraの呼称関係がここで開示。"
    },
    {
      "chapter": 2,
      "verse": 1,
      "sourceText": "Naomi had a relative of her husband’s, a mighty man of wealth, of the family of Elimelech, and his name was Boaz.",
      "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/RUT02.htm#V1",
      "findingJa": "BoazはElimelechの一族に属す富裕/有力者。Ruth夫、Obed父、Salmon子はまだ開示しない。"
    },
    {
      "chapter": 2,
      "verse": 12,
      "sourceText": "May the LORD repay your work, and a full reward be given to you from the LORD, the God of Israel, under whose wings you have come to take refuge.”",
      "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/RUT02.htm#V12",
      "findingJa": "God of Israelの集団Israel索引欠落を発見、既存canonical同一ID追加提案。"
    },
    {
      "chapter": 3,
      "verse": 12,
      "sourceText": "Now it is true that I am a near kinsman. However, there is a kinsman nearer than I.",
      "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/RUT03.htm#V12",
      "findingJa": "より近い無名親族の存在をここより前に導入しない。"
    },
    {
      "chapter": 4,
      "verse": 7,
      "sourceText": "Now this was the custom in former time in Israel concerning redeeming and concerning exchanging, to confirm all things: a man took off his sandal, and gave it to his neighbor; and this was the way of formalizing transactions in Israel.",
      "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/RUT04.htm#V7",
      "findingJa": "Israelは社会慣行の集団名。祖先個人との同一視不可。"
    },
    {
      "chapter": 4,
      "verse": 10,
      "sourceText": "Moreover, Ruth the Moabitess, the wife of Mahlon, I have purchased to be my wife, to raise up the name of the dead on his inheritance, that the name of the dead may not be cut off from among his brothers and from the gate of his place. You are witnesses today.”",
      "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/RUT04.htm#V10",
      "findingJa": "RuthはMahlonの妻であったこととBoaz婚姻の宣言が初めて明示。"
    },
    {
      "chapter": 4,
      "verse": 11,
      "sourceText": "All the people who were in the gate, and the elders, said, “We are witnesses. May the LORD make the woman who has come into your house like Rachel and like Leah, which both built the house of Israel; and treat you worthily in Ephrathah, and be famous in Bethlehem.",
      "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/RUT04.htm#V11",
      "findingJa": "Rachel/Leahの祝福比喩、house of Israelは民/家、Ephrathah/Bethlehemを名指す。"
    },
    {
      "chapter": 4,
      "verse": 12,
      "sourceText": "Let your house be like the house of Perez, whom Tamar bore to Judah, of the offspring which the LORD will give you by this young woman.”",
      "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/RUT04.htm#V12",
      "findingJa": "Perez/Tamar/Judahの系譜祝福。Perezは既存Pharez IDと表記差。"
    },
    {
      "chapter": 4,
      "verse": 13,
